Comment: 1,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.52,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,梦想受到束缚
Comment: 1,0:02:37.05,0:02:39.23,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,沉重命运的磐石
Comment: 1,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.65,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,如同被压迫直至覆灭
Comment: 1,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.02,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,前方已无处逃避
Comment: 1,0:02:47.32,0:02:49.61,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,唯有挣扎着前行
Comment: 1,0:02:49.97,0:02:53.79,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是我永远不会放弃
Comment: 1,0:02:53.84,0:02:59.76,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,瓦砾之中埋藏的
Comment: 1,0:02:59.90,0:03:04.82,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望的碎片
Comment: 1,0:03:05.60,0:03:10.38,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,用这双手 将它们找寻
Comment: 1,0:03:10.47,0:03:15.89,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为改变这世间
Comment: 1,0:03:18.58,0:03:21.25,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fighting Gold
Comment: 1,0:03:21.31,0:03:31.02,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,唯有相信自己的道路之人 终有一天方能闪耀
Comment: 1,0:03:31.66,0:03:39.91,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,燃烧全部生命 即便是神亦无畏惧 战斗永不停息
Comment: 1,0:03:40.15,0:03:44.63,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,不屈的魂灵
Comment: 1,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.05,JOJO5-op1-ch,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fighting Gold
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 2,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.52,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,夢を縛りつける
Comment: 2,0:02:37.05,0:02:39.23,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,重たい運命の石に
Comment: 2,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.65,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,まるで押し潰されて
Comment: 2,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.02,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,どこにも逃げられない
Comment: 2,0:02:47.32,0:02:49.61,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,ひたすら足掻きながら
Comment: 2,0:02:49.97,0:02:53.79,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,だけどあきらめない
Comment: 2,0:02:53.84,0:02:59.76,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,瓦礫の底に埋もれた
Comment: 2,0:02:59.90,0:03:04.82,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望の破片たち
Comment: 2,0:03:05.60,0:03:10.38,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,きっとこの手で見つけだすさ
Comment: 2,0:03:10.47,0:03:15.89,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,世界を変えるために
Comment: 2,0:03:21.31,0:03:31.02,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,自分の道を信じた者だけがいつか輝ける
Comment: 2,0:03:31.66,0:03:39.91,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,命の限り 神にも逆らい 戦い続ける
Comment: 2,0:03:40.15,0:03:44.63,JOJO5-op1-jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,不屈の魂たちよ
